WEBVTT

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:05.330
I wonder what it will be?

00:00:05.330 --> 00:00:07.290
This week, it's this!

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:11.180
It's a card in the Infernity series.

00:00:11.180 --> 00:00:14.710
Its monster effect activates when 
you have zero cards in your hand.

00:00:14.870 --> 00:00:17.720
I was totally surprised.

00:00:17.720 --> 00:00:22.000
My wife and I were looking at the 
drawing on the ground from an airplane.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.960
All of a sudden, it started glowing!

00:00:24.960 --> 00:00:30.400
As I watched in shock, it vanished!

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:33.290
Then I said out loud...

00:00:33.290 --> 00:00:36.570
"The Nazca lines are <i>history</i>!"

00:00:39.330 --> 00:00:43.140
The Dark Signers have 
started to make their move.

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:45.640
You don't understand.

00:00:45.970 --> 00:00:49.630
You risk your life in a battle 
against the Dark Signers.

00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:55.370
However, I vowed to risk my 
life to protect the kids!

00:00:57.510 --> 00:00:59.080
If you're coming, you know the risks.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:02.830
Don't underestimate me.  I'll be your guide!

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:10.720
Come, Yusei.

00:01:13.090 --> 00:01:18.480
That's right.  The war between the 
Signers and Dark Signers begins now!

00:01:22.920 --> 00:01:24.230
What?

00:01:24.940 --> 00:01:27.550
Luca, what's going on?

00:01:30.870 --> 00:01:31.960
Yusei…

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:37.840
I can sense it.

00:01:37.840 --> 00:01:41.000
Yusei, I know you're fighting.

00:01:41.510 --> 00:01:43.920
The vision that Crimson Dragon showed us…

00:01:46.330 --> 00:01:48.530
Is something starting?

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:52.170
So you've forgotten about me.

00:01:57.240 --> 00:01:59.390
No way!  Kiryu?

00:01:59.390 --> 00:02:02.140
You're alive, Kyosuke Kiryu?

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:15.040
Let's settle our destinies here!

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:19.230
This is the field where Signers 
and Dark Signers battle!

00:02:19.230 --> 00:02:20.670
What?

00:02:22.200 --> 00:02:23.160
What's this?

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:29.640
What's that?

00:02:29.640 --> 00:02:31.120
Duel!

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:58.680
Looking over a vast distance

00:02:58.940 --> 00:03:03.780
I realized my field of vision was narrow

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:08.690
Even if it’s easier to throw myself away

00:03:09.050 --> 00:03:13.460
I want to survive to the best of my abilities

00:03:15.320 --> 00:03:18.820
No matter how bad today is

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.810
There’s still the faintest light

00:03:25.570 --> 00:03:29.210
All I have to do tomorrow

00:03:29.510 --> 00:03:33.280
Is light it myself

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:38.280
I test myself so I won’t stop or vanish

00:03:38.650 --> 00:03:43.250
Even if I get countless scars

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:49.550
I ride wishing for the 
arrival of a true tomorrow

00:03:49.860 --> 00:03:53.530
Today will never exist again

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:59.430
So I won’t stop or vanish

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:29.150
Fire of Revenge!
Former Friend Kyosuke Kiryu

00:04:29.700 --> 00:04:30.740
What's this?

00:04:34.360 --> 00:04:39.860
Yusei, I'll send you into the depths of hell!

00:04:41.850 --> 00:04:43.090
Kiryu...

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:46.990
Just so you know, this mark is real!

00:04:49.480 --> 00:04:52.890
It's not the fakes you saw before.

00:05:04.070 --> 00:05:08.510
He's a Dark Signer that 
Godwin was talking about.

00:05:08.510 --> 00:05:12.500
They are the enemies of the Signers.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:18.180
After five thousand years, their 
evil souls have resurrected.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:22.750
Ever since the creation 
of the world, Signers and

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:26.750
Dark Signers have battled 
every five thousand years.

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:35.900
Is this the ancient battle that 
took place five thousand years ago?

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:42.150
Yusei!  What's going on?

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:07.560
What is this?

00:06:11.250 --> 00:06:12.480
What's that?

00:06:17.470 --> 00:06:20.480
What's happening?

00:06:25.100 --> 00:06:26.490
What's that light?

00:06:31.080 --> 00:06:32.920
It has begun.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:40.740
What is that?

00:06:41.820 --> 00:06:43.190
Can it be?

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:51.450
Does this have something to do with the news 
report about the vanishing Nazca lines?

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:02.430
Lower the helicopter!

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:03.650
Okay!

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:14.010
Jack?

00:07:14.010 --> 00:07:15.320
Crow?

00:07:22.970 --> 00:07:25.500
Get closer!

00:07:25.500 --> 00:07:28.520
If we get any closer, we might crash!

00:07:28.520 --> 00:07:30.660
Master Atlas, it's too dangerous!

00:07:30.660 --> 00:07:32.860
Jack, what's wrong with you?

00:07:32.860 --> 00:07:34.410
Do as I say!

00:07:46.810 --> 00:07:49.110
That's Jack.

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:54.160
That's Kiryu!

00:07:54.160 --> 00:07:56.870
We're past the breaking 
point!  I'm heading back up!

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:09.050
This makes me laugh!  Jack Atlas and Crow!

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:12.750
And Yusei.

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:16.350
Kiryu.

00:08:16.990 --> 00:08:21.210
This is hilarious.  I can't believe 
the four of us are all together.

00:08:21.210 --> 00:08:24.220
Did the underworld cause this?

00:08:26.340 --> 00:08:29.430
I will never forgive you.

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:33.000
This fire are the flames of my revenge!

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:35.510
Kiryu, back then…

00:08:35.510 --> 00:08:41.010
I'll never forget that you betrayed 
me and pushed me towards death.

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:45.840
Kiryu…

00:08:48.120 --> 00:08:54.000
He said that he used to be your 
friend.  What does he mean?

00:08:55.110 --> 00:09:02.630
For Yusei, Crow and myself, 
Kiryu was a close friend.

00:09:02.630 --> 00:09:04.210
What?

00:09:23.500 --> 00:09:28.360
Even though your nickname is Crow 
the Bullet, you're not that special.

00:09:31.260 --> 00:09:32.570
You punk!

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:35.200
We're the dueling gang, 
Magicians Four.  I admire your

00:09:35.200 --> 00:09:39.200
courage for coming here alone, even 
though you knew this was our turf.

00:09:39.200 --> 00:09:43.710
But you're nothing more than 
a bullet that misfired!

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:48.170
My Duel Disk!

00:09:58.850 --> 00:10:04.460
Crow the Bullet has already 
pulled the trigger!

00:10:05.460 --> 00:10:09.760
After hearing the sound of my machine 
gun, my friends will be arriving soon!

00:10:13.540 --> 00:10:18.140
Too bad, but we just started 
using this hideout.

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:21.690
No one knows where we are!

00:10:21.690 --> 00:10:23.320
Oh really?

00:10:31.370 --> 00:10:35.870
That Duel Disk is a transmitter?

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.150
Interesting, isn't it?

00:10:38.150 --> 00:10:40.600
It's not interesting, you idiot!

00:10:40.600 --> 00:10:43.390
That means they're coming!

00:10:43.750 --> 00:10:47.000
Team Satisfaction is coming…

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:18.690
Accept my duel!

00:11:30.220 --> 00:11:33.170
The loser's Duel Disk is destroyed.

00:11:33.170 --> 00:11:36.820
We can't stop playing until there's a winner.

00:11:36.930 --> 00:11:38.120
You punk!

00:11:42.870 --> 00:11:44.260
Crow!

00:11:52.330 --> 00:11:54.340
It's time to duel.

00:11:58.510 --> 00:12:01.510
You took care of my friend.

00:12:01.510 --> 00:12:05.760
He has bad manners, so it 
must've been difficult.

00:12:05.760 --> 00:12:07.350
Don't worry.

00:12:07.350 --> 00:12:11.170
I'll thank you plenty!

00:12:16.080 --> 00:12:17.290
Duel!

00:12:17.860 --> 00:12:21.830
My turn!  I summon Speed Warrior!

00:12:26.600 --> 00:12:31.340
My turn!  I summon Blackwing 
- Bora the Spear!

00:12:35.140 --> 00:12:39.150
My turn.  I summon Mad Archfiend!

00:12:47.460 --> 00:12:49.050
Hey, magician.

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:51.550
I'm your opponent.

00:12:52.280 --> 00:12:53.780
You're…

00:12:56.670 --> 00:13:00.720
I'm Kyosuke Kiryu, leader 
of Team Satisfaction.

00:13:00.720 --> 00:13:02.950
Entertain me.

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:27.090
Let's duel!

00:13:29.370 --> 00:13:31.630
I'm looking forward to it!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:34.720
Duel!

00:13:34.720 --> 00:13:37.510
Junk Warrior attacks you directly!

00:13:41.840 --> 00:13:45.350
Blackwing Armor Master attacks!

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:53.990
Exploder Dragonwing attacks you directly!

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:06.110
Dark Eradicator Warlock attacks!

00:14:06.850 --> 00:14:09.600
The trap card Hate Buster!

00:14:37.580 --> 00:14:39.790
We did it.

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:45.250
All right!  We've conquered District D.

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:55.980
Kiryu…

00:14:55.980 --> 00:15:00.020
It was fun back then, wasn't it Yusei?

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:03.880
Wasn't it, Crow?  Jack?

00:15:07.010 --> 00:15:11.060
Jack, what happened between you guys?

00:15:19.950 --> 00:15:24.750
Yusei, Crow and I were friends 
since we were little.

00:15:27.320 --> 00:15:29.290
That's when Kiryu arrived.

00:15:29.290 --> 00:15:35.290
Though we were trapped in Satellite, 
he gave us a tiny ray of hope.

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:53.930
Team Golem will be at District B tonight.

00:15:53.930 --> 00:15:58.000
We'll invade and crush them instantly.

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:06.660
Back then, there were many dueling gangs.  
Each one ruled a different district.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.740
We're going to color this black!

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:18.380
No matter what we do, we 
can't escape from Satellite.

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:21.040
That means we have to be 
satisfied with staying here.

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:24.770
Let's do incredible things at 
Satellite so that we're satisfied!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:29.770
If we never met Kiryu, 
being stuck in Satellite

00:16:29.770 --> 00:16:34.770
would have overwhelmed us.  
We would've become garbage.

00:16:36.380 --> 00:16:40.630
He was our savior.

00:16:40.630 --> 00:16:42.330
Team Satisfaction!

00:16:42.330 --> 00:16:43.620
Let's go!

00:16:58.210 --> 00:16:59.540
Duel!

00:17:14.710 --> 00:17:17.730
This fire represents my anger!

00:17:17.730 --> 00:17:21.450
It won't vanish until there's a winner!

00:17:22.030 --> 00:17:23.220
Kiryu!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:27.870
Let's start the battle between 
a Signer and a Dark Signer.

00:17:27.870 --> 00:17:32.880
This life-or-death battle 
is between former friends!

00:17:40.660 --> 00:17:42.820
Here I go, Yusei!

00:17:47.070 --> 00:17:51.490
Kiryu, why are you a Dark Signer?

00:17:53.100 --> 00:17:54.700
Kiryu…

00:18:02.700 --> 00:18:06.130
Field Spell Speed World set on!

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:10.330
Duel Mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:18:12.930 --> 00:18:16.740
Duel Mode on.  Autopilot standby.

00:18:17.770 --> 00:18:20.330
You're serious, Kiryu.

00:18:22.420 --> 00:18:26.220
The field is under the 
control of Speed World.

00:18:26.220 --> 00:18:29.070
The only spells that can be 
activated are Speed Spells!

00:18:29.070 --> 00:18:32.390
Let's enjoy this Riding Duel!

00:18:32.390 --> 00:18:35.510
The blows in this duel will be real.

00:18:35.510 --> 00:18:37.780
We may actually lose our lives!

00:18:37.780 --> 00:18:44.150
That's right.  Yusei, I'll pummel 
you until you can't take it anymore!

00:18:51.160 --> 00:18:52.570
Duel!

00:18:57.670 --> 00:19:01.580
Put Yusei and Kiryu's duel on the monitor!

00:19:01.580 --> 00:19:03.530
Yes, Master Atlas.

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:17.620
Yusei…  Kiryu…

00:19:19.820 --> 00:19:20.560
Kiryu.

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:26.390
Let's begin.  Team Satisfaction is back!

00:19:29.360 --> 00:19:33.990
My turn!  I summon Infernity Beast!

00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:40.570
I set one card and end my turn.

00:19:40.570 --> 00:19:41.720
Now bring it!

00:19:41.720 --> 00:19:47.370
I'm counting on a tough battle 
to stoke my flames of revenge!

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.350
I have no choice.

00:19:49.350 --> 00:19:51.110
My turn!

00:19:53.790 --> 00:19:57.070
I summon Speed Warrior in attack position!

00:20:00.270 --> 00:20:05.900
During the Battle Phase of this turn, 
Speed Warrior's attack points are doubled!

00:20:05.900 --> 00:20:09.900
Speed Warrior attacks Infernity Beast!

00:20:09.970 --> 00:20:11.820
Sonic Edge!

00:20:12.290 --> 00:20:14.120
I open my trap card!

00:20:14.120 --> 00:20:16.370
Depth Amulet!

00:20:16.380 --> 00:20:21.040
I discard one card from my hand 
to negate your monster's attack!

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:28.050
You never change your deck, so 
I know exactly what you'll do!

00:20:28.050 --> 00:20:31.600
You're saying that you've changed?

00:20:32.710 --> 00:20:34.760
Thanks to you!

00:20:36.380 --> 00:20:39.410
I set two cards and end my turn.

00:20:44.110 --> 00:20:45.840
My turn!

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:50.810
I summon Infernity Archfiend from my hand!

00:20:53.950 --> 00:20:57.950
Infernity Beast attacks Speed Warrior!

00:20:57.950 --> 00:20:59.960
Hell Howling!

00:21:06.870 --> 00:21:10.220
Dance the dance of death, Yusei!

00:21:13.930 --> 00:21:20.220
This is a real Riding Duel!  It's 
different than your childish games!

00:21:23.720 --> 00:21:26.030
The battle isn't over yet!

00:21:26.030 --> 00:21:29.810
Infernity Archfiend attacks Yusei directly!

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:31.600
Hell Pressure!

00:21:37.040 --> 00:21:37.920
Yusei!

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:39.330
Yusei!

00:21:49.130 --> 00:21:51.930
Die, Yusei!

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:18.040
We look up and vow towards the shining light

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:23.110
We will build our own future

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:28.550
The far dawn shines blindingly

00:22:29.020 --> 00:22:33.730
Awaken in the wonderland

00:22:39.330 --> 00:22:48.870
The overflowing wave of emotions approaches

00:22:49.300 --> 00:22:54.440
This world can’t be solved using algorithms

00:22:54.510 --> 00:22:59.150
Even if it loses its light

00:22:59.610 --> 00:23:04.410
The hourglass behind the 
heart can’t be turned

00:23:04.420 --> 00:23:08.890
Roll the dice and get 
out and follow the light

00:23:09.090 --> 00:23:14.470
Fly towards tomorrow faster than a heartbeat

00:23:14.590 --> 00:23:19.270
This journey has no end

00:23:19.570 --> 00:23:24.810
There’s no meaning 
because there are no tears

00:23:25.240 --> 00:23:30.050
Hear my voice
